;------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; INPAUX$ / INPMID$: everything waiting in the RS232 (INPAUX$) or MIDI (INPMID$) input buffer as a
; string, taken straight from the BIOS IOREC buffer, which is then marked empty.
; Exit: the string from STcreat
