;------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; CURVE x0,y0,x1,y1,x2,y2,x3,y3: draws a Bezier curve from (x0,y0) to (x3,y3) with control points
; (x1,y1) and (x2,y2), as a 33-point polyline (v_pline) evaluated in 32 steps with fixed point Horner
; sums of a*t^3 + b*t^2 + c*t.
; Entry: d1,d2 = x0,y0; d3,d4 = x1,y1; d5,d6 = x2,y2; d7,d0 = x3,y3
; Exit: through Xvdi (v_pline)
